## AlQuran.cloud API

AlQuran.cloud is a RESTful Quran API that provides:
- Multiple translations and recitations
- Well-structured JSON/XML formats
- Free access with no API key required
- Comprehensive metadata (juz, page, manzil, ruku, sajda)

Website: https://alquran.cloud/
Documentation: https://alquran.cloud/api

