## Technical Details

### Data Structure
Each JSON file contains:
- Metadata (language, total surahs, total ayahs)
- Array of surahs with:
  - Surah ID, name, transliteration, translation
  - Revelation type (Makkiyyah/Madaniyyah)
  - Ayah count
  - Array of ayahs with text and metadata

### Metadata Fields (Arabic only)
- **page:** Mushaf page number (1-604)
- **juz:** Juz/para number (1-30)
- **manzil:** Manzil number (1-7, for weekly completion)
- **ruku:** Ruku/section number
- **hizbQuarter:** Hizb quarter number (1-240)
- **sajda:** Boolean indicating prostration verse

### File Sizes
- quran_ar_hafs.json: 2.55 MB (63,570 lines)
- quran_en_translation.json: 1.21 MB (26,094 lines)
- quran_fr_translation.json: 1.25 MB (26,094 lines)

## Updates and Maintenance

